[97.746088, "o", "- Interval changes incorrectly retained the old cycle. They now charge the full\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   new price, re-anchor on the change date, and use the new interval for renewal.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - Half-even rounding now operates on an exact rational value, without dependence\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   on decimal precision. Public function signatures are unchanged.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## Validation\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - All ten finance worked examples match through `python -m billing preview`,\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   including invoice amounts, carried credit, and line period ends.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - Added 12 passing regression tests for month-end/leap-year boundaries, pricing,\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   interval changes, and exact rounding.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - Full release command: `cd /app && python -m unittest discover -s tests`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   Result: 29 tests, 1 error; all other tests pass.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## Release blocker — not safe to ship yet\r\n\u001b[?2"]
[97.746199, "o", "004l\r\u001b[?2004h> The baseline already had a partner-data error, which remains:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> `PartnerInvoiceTest.test_partner_commission_lines` raises `KeyError: 'P-31'`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> `data/subscriptions.json` assigns sub_1151 to P-31, but\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> `data/partners.json` has no P-31 entry or contracted commission rate. No source\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> for that rate exists in the project. Obtain the authoritative contract/rate\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> from Finance, correct the partner data, and rerun the full suite before release.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> Partner data and existing tests were not altered, and no fallback rate or test\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> skip was introduced.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> EOF\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
